3. **`instagram_business_manage_comments`**: Membaca komentar publik yang masuk di Post/Reels dan melakukan *Public Auto-Reply Comment*.
4. **`instagram_business_manage_insights`**: Fondasi *Killing Feature* **Revenue & Conversion Analytics**.
5. **`instagram_business_content_publish`**: Fondasi *Killing Feature* **Auto Publishing / Schedule Content**.

